ndw8.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A3%82%E8%84%8A%E5%88%BA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/31/t27k682gon34829m4og7fn1p4csndw8.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%A3%82%E8%84%8A%E5%88%BA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/31/t27k682gon34829m4og7fn1p4csndw8.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />裂脊刺\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>普攻\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>近战、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（普攻）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">110%</font>物理伤害。造成[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">背击</span>]时，无视目标[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-1 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/i12b13xi6nu